    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a little, square guy trapped in a maze of cardboard boxes filled with a myriad of challenges. The rules are simple: move the diamonds to the appropriate pressure plates without letting different-colored diamonds touch\u2014swap, push, and phase to complete levels as quickly as possible. Do you have what it takes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This is my first ever full-release game, so any improvement ideas are always appreciated. Feel free to leave a review or message me directly. Hope you enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Music Attributions</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anime Fight Music Loop #1 by Sirkoto51 --  -- License: Attribution 4.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Battle Loop #3 by Sirkoto51 --  -- License: Attribution 4.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Puzzle Music Loop by Sirkoto51 --  -- License: Attribution 4.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spy/Secret Agent Loop by Sirkoto51 --  -- License: Attribution 4.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success Loop #1.wav by Sirkoto51 --  -- License: Attribution 4.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>SFX Attributions</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cardboard Hit 04 by AxelSpeller --  -- License: Attribution 4.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cardboard Tear Short 01 by AxelSpeller --  -- License: Attribution 4.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glass Break - Small Jar 01 by RoganMcDougald --  -- License: Attribution 3.0</p>",
